        "text": "Ferries cross to Xuwen and Beihai from New Port and Xiuying Port."
      },
      {
        "mode": "Rental car",
        "has": false,
        "text": "Not needed for a city visit; use taxis, buses and trains instead."
      },
      {
        "mode": "Walking",
        "has": true,
        "text": "Good around Bo'ai Old Street and the waterfront in the cooler months; use rides in summer heat."
      }
